        "Telephone number with area code. Format (xxx) xxx-xxxx"
        phone: String

        "Fax number. Format (xxx) xxx-xxxx"
        fax: String

        "Organization's website URL. Includes the http:// or https:// prefix."
        website: String

        "Miscellaneous information about the organization."
        notes: String

        "Miscellaneous information about stored as [JSON](https://namc-utah.github.io/namc-bug-db/API/metadata.html). Typically used during scripting and automated processes."
